Simple Storage service ( S3 ) 
>> It is storage for the internet. means can access file via internet , if you have to access file or data. 
>> S3 object based storage. 
>> You can't install operating system on S3. 
>> S3 has a distributed data store architecture where data are redundantly store in multiple location. means data have copy  at different location. 
>> Data is store in bucket. kind of folder or drive. 
>> Bucket is flat container of object. means you can't create bucket inside the bucket ( nested  bucket ) 
>> Max capacity of a bucket is 5TB. 
>> Max can have 100 bucket per account , but can be extended via requesting amazon. 
>> You can create folder in you bucket ( available through console )
>>  Bucket ownweship is non transferable. 
>> S3 is region specific. 

** S3 bucket naming rules. 
>> S3 bucket names are globally unique across all AWS region. 
>> Bucket name can't be change after they are created. 
>> If a bucket is deleted , it became available again to you or to other account to use. 
>> Bucket name must altest 3 and no more than 63 characters long. 
>> bucket names are part of the url used to access bucket. 
>> Bucket name must be a series on one or more label. means space among two label is not allowed, need to used dot ( . )
>> Bucket name can contain lowercase, number and hypen, Uppercase letter are not allowed. 
>> Bucket name should not be an IP address. 
>> Each label must start and end with lowercase letter or a number. 
>> By default , bucket and it's objects are private, by default only owner can access the bucket. 


** S3 bucket - subresources
Sub resoureces for S3 Bucket. 
>> Lifecycle : to decide on object lifecycle management. means moving less important/not frequently used  data to different location or archiving data. 
>> Website : To hold configuration related to static website hosted in S3 bucket. 
>> Versioning : object version as it changes (  Get updated ) means keep all version of file , in case you need older version. versioning can't be disable once enabled.
>> Access contol list : Bucket policies : to grant access to differnet user. 
Note : The name is simple two parts bucket region endpoint / bucket name 
for eg : https:// S3-eu-west.amazon.com/mybucket


